/**
 * requestFacets.heldout2.spec.ts — second held-out facet set (eval-0927 P0-2).
 * 70 items (35 EN + 35 JA, 20 negatives) generated by EVO-X2 in a fresh
 * context (2026-09-27) over domains the first set never used (emulators,
 * DSP, firmware, stream processing, printing, mail delivery, payments,
 * mobile). Labels adjudicated by the orchestrator: `adjudicated:false` items
 * (a "default branch" question that is arguably a value question about repo
 * configuration) are reported but never asserted; `toleratedExtra` lists a
 * facet an item may also predict without counting as a false positive
 * ("maximum N before validation rejects it" is a value question that also
 * reads as a condition).
 *
 * This set was first scored BLIND against the FIX-C1 extractor (recall
 * value 0.39 / condition 0.69 / callers 0.38 / flow 0.50, exact-set 20/50,
 * 1/18 negatives with a false facet) and then used as a DEVELOPMENT set for
 * the recall generalization; a third, unseen set is the blind check. Every
 * rule in requestFacets.ts must stay a general question frame — this file
 * only SCORES; it must never gain an item-specific branch.
 */
